WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.560
Heat sets off chains. Cut one link, and you can ease many.

2
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:10.920
A hot night costs sleep. Lost sleep costs a shift. A lost shift costs a repayment.

3
00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:17.000
Start with shade and paid rest, early warning, and cooler homes.

4
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.500
Twenty-nine actions, each mapped to the cycles it can break.
